{"error": false, "page": 1, "prepage": 100, "pageCount": 1, "recordCount": 9, "data": [{"docid2": 2107778, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107778.htm", "content": "\n　　序号\n　　受理部门\n　　详细地址\n　　联系电话\n　　交通指引\n　　1\n　　三明市人力资源和社会保障局\n　　 \n　　三元区新市北路345号\n　　杜鹃新村32幢一楼\n　　（三明市人社局工伤保险科）\n　　0598-7506638\n　", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107778.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.18 15:10:00", "doctitle": "三明市各级人社部门工伤认定申请地址及联系方式一览表", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2327303, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107778.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2107776, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107776.htm", "content": "\n　　（一）工伤认定申请表\n　　申请人需如实填报个人基本信息、用人单位信息、申报事项等内容，确保信息准确无误，并由本人签字确认。由用人单位申请的，还需在申请表申请单位盖章处盖用人单位公章并由单位经办人员", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107776.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.18 15:08:00", "doctitle": "申请工伤认定所需材料清单", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2327302, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107776.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "附件1.工伤认定申请表.docx", "appdocid": 2107776, "appfile": "P020250318545935948777.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107776.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202503/P020250318/P020250318545935948777.docx", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/P020250318545935948777.docx"}, {"appdesc": "附件2.委托书模板.docx", "appdocid": 2107776, "appfile": "P020250318545936248774.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 2, "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107776.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202503/P020250318/P020250318545936248774.docx", "_href": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/P020250318545936248774.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2107773, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107773.htm", "content": "\n　　问：什么是工伤认定？\n　　答：工伤认定是指社会保险行政部门根据国家的授权，对职工因事故伤害（或者患职业病）是否属于工伤或者是否视同工伤给予定性的行政确认行为。\n　　问：工伤认定的申请主体包括哪些？\n", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107773.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.18 15:07:00", "doctitle": "工伤认定常见问题解答——维护劳动者权益，这些知识要知道！", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2327301, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/t20250318_2107773.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202503/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2097009, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202501/t20250122_2097009.htm", "content": "\n　　为切实保障职工的生命安全和身体健康，预防和减少工伤事故的发生。近日，市人社局针对近期职业病类工伤案件频发的某单位，发出《工伤预防工作提醒函》，提醒该单位和职工应当遵守有关安全生产和职业病防治的法律", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202501/t20250122_2097009.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.22 18:48:00", "doctitle": "三明市人社局全省首创工伤预防提醒机制", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2327300, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202501/t20250122_2097009.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2096504, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/t20250121_2096504.htm", "content": "\n　　一、支持企业春节期间连续生产\n　　对经当地工信部门认定，2025年春节当月保持连续生产的规模以上工业企业，1月用电量不低于2024年12月用电量75%（含75%）的，按用工人数（以1月份企业参加失业保险人数为准）给", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/t20250121_2096504.htm", "docreltime": "2025.01.21 15:59:00", "doctitle": "三明市2025年保用工促开局十条措施及政策申报指南", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2302511, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/t20250121_2096504.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/tzgg/202501/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2064907, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/gsbx/202409/t20240929_2064907.htm", "content": "\n　　一是事前沟通准备到位。立足办事流程精简、高效的原则，提前与税务部门进行对接，进一步了解税务参保缴费及工伤保险费用扣款的相关要求，在单位办理工伤保险参保登记时一并将税务办理流程及要求予以告知，减少经", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/t20240929_2064907.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.29 17:46:00", "doctitle": "将乐县：服务为本“四到位”规范事业单位工伤参保关系", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2255213, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/t20240929_2064907.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2063098, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/gsbx/202409/t20240924_2063098.htm", "content": "\n　　为贯彻落实习近平总书记关于社会保险基金安全的重要指示批示精神，进一步提升工伤保险全链条、一体化管理服务水平，提高市、县两级人社部门依法行政水平，我局锚定工伤保险基金管理风险点，从四个方面严防工伤保", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/t20240924_2063098.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.24 16:05:00", "doctitle": "市人社局：锚定管理风险点  严防工伤保险基金变成“唐僧肉”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2255214, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/t20240924_2063098.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2062233, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/gsbx/202409/t20240920_2062233.htm", "content": "\n　　为进一步提高依法行政水平，我市人社部门多措并举，创新工作机制，努力提速办理案件，维护工伤职工合法权益，赋能工伤职工维权跑出“加速度”。\n　　一是提速办理工伤认定案件。人社部门收到工伤认定申请后，材", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/t20240920_2062233.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.20 16:21:00", "doctitle": "我市人社部门“五项举措”赋能工伤职工维权跑出“加速度”", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2255215, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/t20240920_2062233.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2030503, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "工伤保险", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/shbxyjz/gsbx/202405/t20240529_2030503.htm", "content": "\n　　一是强化工伤政策宣传。开展工伤保险政策进机关、进企业、进工地等宣传活动，通过有针对性地讲解工伤预防相关知识，提高广大职工对参加工伤保险重要性的认识，将“预防为主”落实到每一天、每一人、每一岗位。截", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202405/t20240529_2030503.htm", "docreltime": "2024.05.29 15:57:00", "doctitle": "大田县：三举措提升工伤保险服务质效", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2255216, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202405/t20240529_2030503.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/xxgk/gzdt/xjdt/202405/", "rels": []}]}